      },
      "text": "Bus to Puno: After breakfast, board a bus for a scenic journey to Puno, located on the shores of Lake Titicaca. As you travel through the highlands, enjoy the stunning landscapes of the Peruvian altiplano, with rolling hills, vast plains, and traditional Andean villages.\n\nOvernight: Upon arrival in Puno, check into your accommodation and spend the night in this charming city, known as the gateway to Lake Titicaca, ready for your next adventure."
